## Resource dependency map

Everything the build needs, in the order it must exist. Items marked ✅ already
exist from the builder image work — verify, don't recreate.

```
[cluster scope]
  ClusterBuildStrategy  buildah-hl            ← Step 2 (this repo)

[namespace: openshift-builds]
  ConfigMap   hobbylobby.corp        ✅  internal CA bundle (mounted by strategy)
  Secret      <git-clone-secret>     ✅  type kubernetes.io/ssh-auth (or basic-auth)
  Secret      pipeline-push-secret   ✅  type kubernetes.io/dockerconfigjson
  SA          pipeline               ✅  linked to pipeline-push-secret
  RoleBinding rb-pipeline-image-builder ✅  grants system:image-builder to SA
  Build       rfipconfig-be-runtime-image  ← Step 3 (this repo)
  BuildRun    rfipconfig-be-runtime-image-<hash> ← Step 4 (this repo)

[git repo]
  runtime-image/Dockerfile           ← Step 1
  runtime-image/entrypoint.sh        ← Step 1
```

**Pre-flight check (run before Step 2):**

```bash
oc whoami                                                  # token valid? (~24h expiry)
oc get configmap hobbylobby.corp -n openshift-builds
oc get secret pipeline-push-secret -n openshift-builds \
  -o jsonpath='{.type}'                                    # must print: kubernetes.io/dockerconfigjson
oc get sa pipeline -n openshift-builds
oc get rolebinding rb-pipeline-image-builder -n openshift-builds
```

