## Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
|---------|-------|-----|
| `x509: certificate signed by unknown authority` | CA not visible to buildah | `SSL_CERT_FILE` env in Build + CA volume mount in strategy; configMap must exist in `openshift-builds` |
| `authentication required` on push | Wrong secret type / missing RBAC / nonexistent namespace | Secret type must be `dockerconfigjson`; SA needs `system:image-builder`; target namespace must exist |
| `Reason: BuildStrategyNotFound` | Strategy name mismatch or Step 2 skipped | `Build.spec.strategy.name` must equal applied strategy name |
| Pod stuck `ContainerCreating` | Volume source missing | CA configMap absent in `openshift-builds` |
| `oc get build ...` not found | CRD name collision | Use `oc get builds.shipwright.io` |
| Console BuildRun page crashes (React #310) | OCPBUGS-84214 | Known plugin bug — verify via CLI; fixed in OCP 4.21.19+ |

